# 12: hold R1 on a chord on the piano roll: it goes anywhere in the cell, whole, and lands where R1 is let go.
title CARRY A CHORD
about Hold R1 on a chord and steer it with the D-pad, the stick or L1 for an octave: every key goes with it, its length kept, over what is in its way; let go and it lands. B with R1 held puts it back.
caption PIANO ROLL
run --demo --view notes
from 0.8
